   "notes": "Described the base Mixtral 8x7B, the only size configuration given (Table 1). The paper says it uses the same modifications as Mistral 7B, except for dense 32k attention and MoE FFNs. On that basis RMSNorm, pre-norm, RoPE and the residual structure are marked inherited. RoPE theta and pairing, norm eps, biases and tied embeddings are not stated in this paper, so they are left not_stated. Mistral 7B's sliding window is explicitly replaced here by fully dense attention, so attention is exact with window 0. The gate is a softmax over the top-K logits with the rest set to -inf, which is renorm."
